title: "Blob Tracking in TouchDesigner"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A ready-to-run TouchDesigner project that detects and tracks blobs in video
  in real time and draws the result as square markers with pixel-coordinate
  labels, connected by thin lines, composited over the source footage.
